_b1u4(1,'Zero conditional: facts — at school','Use if + present simple, present simple for facts and general truths.','If you mix blue and yellow, you get green.','Si tu mélanges le bleu et le jaune, tu obtiens du vert.','Which sentence states a general fact? Example 1: at school.',['If you mix blue and yellow, you get green.','If you mixed blue and yellow, you will got green.','If you will mix blue and yellow, it gets green.'],0,'The zero conditional describes general facts.'),
