_b1u4(6,'First conditional: real possibilities — at school','Use if + present simple, will + base verb for a possible future result.','If I finish my homework, I will play football.','Si je termine mes devoirs, je jouerai au football.','First conditional: real possibilities: choose the sentence that uses this structure correctly (at school).',['If it rains, we will stay inside.','If it will rain, we stay inside.','If rains, we staying inside.'],0,'Do not normally use will in the if-clause.'),
